      "EVALUATOR_AUTO_FAIL_TRIGGERS": "- Unresolved '{{...}}' template token, or a leftover bootstrap comment (an HTML\n  comment opening with the word BOOTSTRAP), in any emitted/instance file.\n- A template token used anywhere under skills/agent-kit/templates/ that is not documented\n  in the placeholder table of skills/agent-kit/SKILL.md.\n- Frontmatter `name:` not matching its folder name (skills) or file name (agents).\n- Hardcoded model IDs anywhere outside the model map (canonical:\n  skills/agent-kit/templates/models.map.md; instance: {{IDE_DIR}}/skills/agent-kit-models.map.md).\n- Instance- or session-specific content leaked INTO canonical templates — the\n  canonical kit under skills/agent-kit/ must stay project-agnostic (product isolation).\n- Template ↔ emitter drift — an emitter under skills/agent-kit/emitters/ referencing\n  files, paths, or keys that no longer exist in templates/.",
      "EXECUTION_LAYERS": "skills/<name>/ (published skills; agent-kit: templates/ → bin/ + emitters/ → reference/harness-matrix.md) → scripts/checks/ + tests/ → docs/ + root README.md / skills.sh.json / marketplace manifests",
